   * `{ meta: { name: string }, rules: Record<string, HostRule> }`.
   * Use `defineRule` from `oxlint-plugin-react-doctor` for the
   * cleanest authoring shape — see CONTRIBUTING.md → "Writing a
   * custom plugin" for the full template.
